# Album Store — CS 6650 ChaosArena v1

Go REST API for the `v1-album-store` contract.

## Architecture

| Layer | Choice | Why |
|-------|--------|-----|
| HTTP | Go + Chi | fast, minimal allocations |
| Metadata | DynamoDB (PAY_PER_REQUEST) | no connection limits; atomic counters built-in |
| File storage | S3 + Transfer Manager | multipart upload for large files (S15) |
| Async processing | In-process goroutine pool | avoids SQS round-trip; lowest POST→completed latency |

