## Tuning

| Env var | Default | Notes |
|---------|---------|-------|
| PORT | 8080 | HTTP listen port |
| WORKER_COUNT | NumCPU × 16 | Background upload goroutines |
| ALBUMS_TABLE | albums | DynamoDB table name |
| PHOTOS_TABLE | photos | DynamoDB table name |
| S3_BUCKET | (required) | S3 bucket name |
| AWS_REGION | from SDK | AWS region |

For heavier load (S15), bump to a **c5.2xlarge** or **m5.2xlarge** instance.